<title>USA: Chile seeks 960,000 bbls of crude for Sept 16-20.</title>
<headline>Chile seeks 960,000 bbls of crude for Sept 16-20.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chile's state oil refiner Empresa Nacional del Petroleo (ENAP) is seeking to buy 960,000 barrels of crude for September 16-20 arrival, trade sources said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Bids are due on July 31.</p>
<p>Chile normally buys a combination of Ecuadoran Oriente crude and a West African grade such as Palanca.</p>
<p>--Patricia Garip-Bertuol NY Energy Desk ((+1 212 859 1620))</p>
</text>
